Diagram:
  name: Scale and Chord System
  version: 1.0
  version-ptd: 1.1
  description: Documentation of the scale and chord system, showing relationships between
               change-scale.js and play-chord.js modules
  files: change-scale.js, play-chord.js, globals.js

Imports:
  change-scale.js (changeScaleFilter, setActiveScaleFilter, setActiveScaleFilterToMatchChord)
    --> globals.js (globals)
    --> jam-mapping-to-allowed.js (buildNoteMap)
    --> findMatchingScales.js (findTop3MatchingScales)
    --> note-tools.js (createChordSymbol)
    --> chord-to-scale.js (chordSymbolToScaleNames)
    --> scaleToNotes.js (scaleObjToNotes, chordNotesToScaleNotes)
  
  play-chord.js (playChord, playChordOff)
    --> globals.js (globals)
    --> change-scale.js (changeScaleFilter)
    --> general-midi.js (playGmNote, stopGmNote)

Files:
  file: change-scale.js
    Variables:
      const scaleObj
      let scaleName
      let scaleNotes
    Functions:
      changeScaleFilter(scaleFilter): void
      setActiveScaleFilter(scaleTonic, scaleType, scaleNotes, scaleTypes): void
      setActiveScaleFilterToMatchChord(chordTonic, chordType): void
      _setActiveScaleFilter(scaleNotes): void
      calcScaleTypesDropdown(chordConfig): string[]
      calcScaleTypesDropdownFromChordSymbol(chordSymbol): string[]
      reportScaleChange(msg): void

  file: play-chord.js
    Variables:
      const noteOffInfo: NoteOffInfo
    Functions:
      playChord(singleNote, options): void
      playChordOff(singleNote): void
      playChordNote(noteName, toneType, options, channel, triggerNote, pendingNoteOffs): void
      changeChordTriggerNoteAndThusScale(singleNote): void

Classes:
  class: NoteOffInfo
    Attributes:
      allowedNote: string
      pitch: number
      velocity: number
      envelope: object
    
  class: ChordOptions
    Attributes:
      originNote: Note
      duration: number
      when: number
      silent: boolean

Use Cases:
  Sequence: Change Scale
    🧍‍♂️ -> changeScaleFilter(scaleFilter) [change-scale.js]
         validates scale filter and chord config
         -> _setActiveScaleFilter(scaleNotes) [change-scale.js]
             builds note map
             -> buildNoteMap() [jam-mapping-to-allowed.js]
                 creates scale trigger map
                 < Map
             < void
         -> reportScaleChange() [change-scale.js]
             broadcasts scale changes
             < void
         < void

  Sequence: Play Chord
    🎹 -> playChord(singleNote, options) [play-chord.js]
         validates chord trigger
         -> changeChordTriggerNoteAndThusScale(singleNote) [play-chord.js]
             updates current chord
             -> changeScaleFilter() [change-scale.js]
                 updates scale filtering
                 < void
             < void
         -> playChordNote() [play-chord.js]
             for each chord note
             -> playGmNote() [general-midi.js]
                 plays MIDI note
                 < void
             < void
         < void

  Sequence: Stop Chord
    🎹 -> playChordOff(singleNote) [play-chord.js]
         validates chord trigger
         -> stopGmNote() [general-midi.js]
             for each pending note off
             stops MIDI note
             < void
         < void

State Flows:
  globals.currentChordTriggerNote
    ⟶ playChord()
    ⟶ changeChordTriggerNoteAndThusScale()
    ⟶ changeScaleFilter()
    ⟶ _setActiveScaleFilter()
    ⟶ buildNoteMap()